      "cooked": "<p>I am having a query report that would show this for creating a timesheet report :</p>\n<p>SELECT<br>\nDATE(tsd.from_time)                                       AS work_date,<br>\nDATE_FORMAT(tsd.from_time, ‘%%a %%m/%%d’)                 AS x_label,<br>\nts.employee                                               AS employee,<br>\nCOALESCE(ts.employee_name, ‘’)                            AS employee_name,<br>\nROUND(SUM(tsd.hours), 2)                                  AS total_hours,<br>\nROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN IFNULL(tsd.is_billable, 0)=1<br>\nTHEN tsd.hours ELSE 0 END), 2)             AS billable_hours,<br>\nROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN IFNULL(tsd.is_billable, 0)=0<br>\nTHEN tsd.hours ELSE 0 END), 2)             AS non_billable_hours,<br>\nROUND(100 * SUM(CASE WHEN IFNULL(tsd.is_billable, 0)=1<br>\nTHEN tsd.hours ELSE 0 END)<br>\n/ NULLIF(SUM(tsd.hours), 0), 2)                     AS billable_pct<br>\nFROM <code>tabTimesheet</code> ts<br>\nJOIN <code>tabTimesheet Detail</code> tsd ON tsd.parent = ts.name<br>\nWHERE ts.docstatus IN (0, 1)<br>\nAND ( %(start_date)s IS NULL OR DATE(tsd.from_time) &gt;= %(start_date)s )<br>\nAND ( %(end_date)s   IS NULL OR DATE(tsd.from_time) &lt;= %(end_date)s )<br>\nAND ( %(employee)s   IS NULL OR %(employee)s = ‘’ OR ts.employee = %(employee)s )<br>\nGROUP BY work_date, ts.employee<br>\nORDER BY work_date ASC, ts.employee ASC;</p>\n<p>I am getting key error start date and end date. I am unable to add default start date and end date in filter. Also help me to understand how can I use filter to automatically select all employees from the list ?</p>\n<p>I generally get this result which is want I want<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/8/a8d6b76373e995eb909f957441beb051cc01d3f1.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a8d6b76373e995eb909f957441beb051cc01d3f1\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploa